{{! spritesheetbelli template
name: libGDX / Spine .atlas
extension: atlas
per_page: false
rotation: counter-clockwise

Trimmed frames keep their size with borders ("orig") and where the packed pixels are in
it ("offset"), which libGDX measures from the bottom. A turned frame has its size before
turning: libGDX's TexturePacker writes "rotate: true" for regions it turned 90°
counter-clockwise, and its TextureAtlas and Spine's runtimes read them that way.
}}
{{#pages}}

{{image}}
size: {{w}}, {{h}}
format: RGBA8888
filter: Nearest, Nearest
repeat: none
{{#frames}}
{{name}}
  rotate: {{rotated}}
  xy: {{x}}, {{y}}
  size: {{w}}, {{h}}
  orig: {{source_w}}, {{source_h}}
  offset: {{trim_left}}, {{trim_bottom}}
  index: -1
{{/frames}}
{{/pages}}
